.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBuUDZOZF9vU1YweF9YT25SOE4zVmlxQlV1VF9OYjhid3U4bHU4azU3V0hYYlROX2Q2THp5OTZZd1U3TVl3eDBYZHFVM2FxTHdpcjhHTGhESkE1a3VZSlhtT1Z0RXJGb3g4MXJWd3ZpYUlDUkZvdWpBdWR6eVI0dzQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"SoFi Technologies 獲利超預期並實現 2027 年大膽目標後股價飆升"},{"title":"SoFi Reports Third Quarter 2026 with Record Net Revenue of $1.4 Billion, Net Income of $241 Million and Raises Full-Year Guidance","src":"SoFi Investor Relations","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"SoFi 公佈 2026 年第三季淨營收創歷史新高，達 14 億美元，淨利達 2.41 億美元，並調高全年指引"},{"title":"SoFi Lifts Outlook After Memberships and Lending Grow","src":"WSJ","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPbERxM2RadS1mR0t2M2ZsRXZGRTNFeUZxNTUycmJjc1pjRkxrRE10SGdUS2FST2xvMGp2MC1uRU95cW12dHd6b01aOUMzUExqbTZfMTZQd2VmQUlkdjZMczRWdXJySG5QbGJlR1FlNjZqeDJaeFVqQmNoSktidDhSSlRYaUVUUFkwX05ocVNnVjNxVEMyUVFUcmRqYnE2MG1zVjM2Ti1lLVNMYnM?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"會員數和貸款成長後 SoFi 提升前景"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818874/000181887426000013/sofi-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a mission driven company designed to help our members achieve financial independence in order to realize their ambitions. To us, financial independence does not mean being wealthy, but rather represents the ability of our members to have the financial means to achieve their personal objectives at each stage of life, such as owning a home, having a family, or having a career of their choice — more simply stated, to have enough money to do what they want. We were founded in 2011 and have developed a suite of financial products that offers the speed, selection, content and convenience that only an integrated digital platform can provide. In order for us to achieve our mission, we have to help people get their money right, which means providing them with the ability to borrow better, save better, spend better, invest better and protect better. Everything we do today is geared toward h","zh":null},{"en":"In order to help achieve our mission, we are a member-centric, one-stop shop for financial services that, through our Lending and Financial Services products, allows members to borrow, save, spend, invest and protect their money. We refer to our customers as \"members\" and \"clients\". We offer personal loans, student loans, home loans and related servicing and offer a variety of financial services products, such as SoFi Money, SoFi Credit Card, SoFi Crypto, SoFi Invest and SoFi Relay, that provide more daily interactions with our members, as well as products and capabilities, such as SoFi At Work, that are designed to appeal to enterprises. Lending related services that we offer through our Loan Platform Business help a broader range of borrowers to find lending solutions, through our relationships with members as well as third-party enterprise partners. Our Technology Platform supports in","zh":null},{"en":"We have built a personalized area within our digital native application, which we refer to as the member home experience. The member home experience is personalized and delivers content to a member about what they must do that day in their financial life, what they should consider doing that day in their financial life, and what they could do that day in their financial life. Through the member home experience, there are significant opportunities to build frequent engagement and, to date, the member home experience has been an important driver of new product adoption. The member home experience is an important part of our strategy and our ability to use data as a competitive advantage.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Technology Platform","val":360792000,"zh":"Technology Platform"},{"name":"Financial Services","val":258561000,"zh":"Financial Services"}],"total":619353000}},"peers":["HOOD","PLTR","COIN","UPST","SMCI"]}}